248 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 216 0 R
/E (This intensive bootcamp transforms you into a AI Forward Deployed Engineer \(AI-FDE\). You will master core software engineering, serverless cloud deployment, and advanced Applied AI, including hybrid RAG, Knowledge Graphs, and Vision AI. Crucially, you will learn to orchestrate autonomous AI agents using LangGraph, securely integrate them with legacy enterprise systems \(SQL, SOAP\), and enforce strict corporate security \(SSO, RBAC\). By the end, you will possess both the technical execution and consulting skills needed to deploy cutting-edge AI into complex, highly regulated environments.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
